# Supabase hub

- Authorization lives in `project_members` / `hub_admins`, never in `user_metadata`.
- Helper functions stay in schema `app` (not exposed on the Data API).
- `project_credentials` has no SELECT for `authenticated`; only Edge Functions with the service role read it.
- `ingest` uses `verify_jwt = false` and a hashed per-project push secret.
- First ingest honors `initialApproval` (`approved`|`unapproved`, default `unapproved`) only when `head_version_hash` is null.
- Later ingest keeps sticky `en_fp` approvals; changed English marks translations stale and stores `previous_text` on source strings.
- Encrypt GitHub tokens with `CREDENTIALS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` before writing `project_credentials`.
